---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="GU NeuroSoc's website uses no cookies, analytics or forms. Membership and tickets are handled by the SRC."
>
  <article class="container-site section">
    <h1 class="headline text-h1 font-black">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose-site mt-8">
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This website doesn't use cookies, analytics or forms. It is a static site hosted on GitHub
        Pages, it loads no third-party scripts, and its fonts are hosted on the site itself.
      </p>
      <h2>Membership and tickets</h2>
      <p>
        Membership and tickets are handled by the SRC, not by this site, under the{' '}
        <a href="https://www.glasgowunisrc.org/privacy/">SRC privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>Emails</h2>
      <p>
        If you email the society, your email is handled under the data-protection clause of the
        society's <a href="/constitution">constitution</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>Theme choice</h2>
      <p>
        If you switch between the light and dark theme, your browser's localStorage remembers that
        choice. That is the only thing the site stores, and it stays in your browser.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:neurosciencesoc@src.gla.ac.uk">neurosciencesoc@src.gla.ac.uk</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
